<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Updated ethics guidance for field studies</title><link rel='stylesheet' href='/static/b.css'></head><body><header><section class='topbar' data-nav-v='2'><span>SIM-B</span> <a href='/'>feed</a> <a href='/about'>about</a> <a href='/archive'>archive</a></section></header><main><section class='entry' data-ref='B-2003'><h2>Updated ethics guidance for field studies</h2><div class='meta'><div class='row'><span class='label'>Ref</span><span class='value'>B-2003</span></div><div class='row'><span class='label'>Issued</span><span class='value'>2026-02-09</span></div></div><div class='content'><p>The guidance replaces the 2023 edition with immediate effect.</p><p>Field teams must file an updated protocol summary.</p></div></section></main><footer class='b-footer' data-footer-v='2'><span>Open notice feed</span><span>maintenance 2</span><span><a href='/status'>status</a></span></footer></body></html>